 "verdict_reason": "Own replication strong: labels from one replicate infection (2% tail) scored by the other give AUROC 0.93-0.99 per line (both directions), and single replicates recover the final labels at 0.84-0.90. Pooled positive rate 4.5% (MOLM-13 5.6%, NOMO-1 3.4%) is plausible for a pathway-focused anchor design. Fitness alone does not predict labels (0.58-0.59). No same-line cross-study data; the 5 overlapping pairs are in other lines and too few to confirm or contradict. Caveat: small, hub-structured (8 anchors), positives concentrated on anchors."
